00:16:51.254 --> 00:16:55.514
It does! I am raising her to be
an ideal woman in every way!

00:16:55.784 --> 00:16:57.494
Ideal...

00:16:57.494 --> 00:16:58.474
...woman?

00:16:58.794 --> 00:17:02.094
There are no ideal women
walking around these days!

00:17:02.094 --> 00:17:06.254
So, I'll craft one myself, harvest
her, and then marry her!

00:17:07.034 --> 00:17:08.434
He's a monster!
He's a monster!

00:17:08.634 --> 00:17:11.174
That day is fast approaching...

00:17:11.174 --> 00:17:13.434
My sweet Naomi...

00:17:14.044 --> 00:17:15.704
BLUE SKIES HOUSING
NEW OWNER

00:17:16.144 --> 00:17:18.164
I'm home, Naomi!

00:17:18.744 --> 00:17:20.304
Welcome home, Supervisor.

00:17:20.544 --> 00:17:23.554
Now, didn't I say you shouldn't
call me "supervisor" at home?

00:17:23.554 --> 00:17:26.074
Oh. Welcome home, Darling.

00:17:26.254 --> 00:17:27.444
"Darling"!

00:17:27.884 --> 00:17:31.914
Darling, shall we eat? Or would you like a bath?

00:17:32.554 --> 00:17:34.894
Or maybe you'd like...

00:17:35.894 --> 00:17:38.464
Or, maybe... Or, maybe... Oh, yeah! Oh, yeah!

00:17:38.464 --> 00:17:41.404
Be jealous of me, you two!

00:17:41.404 --> 00:17:43.064
My sweet Naomi!

00:17:46.474 --> 00:17:48.544
Aren't you gonna fight back?

00:17:48.544 --> 00:17:50.444
Next will be Aoi's turn...

00:17:51.214 --> 00:17:53.304
No! Stop it!

00:17:58.654 --> 00:18:01.084
Just now, in my heart, I saw!

00:18:01.324 --> 00:18:04.324
The more you resist, the hotter it gets me!

00:18:04.324 --> 00:18:07.664
I love how you keep saying "No! No!"

00:18:07.664 --> 00:18:10.934
C'mon, c'mon, aren't you going to run anymore?!

00:18:10.934 --> 00:18:13.294
That's it, Kaoru!

00:18:13.464 --> 00:18:15.794
The thing in my heart holding me back is!

00:18:18.704 --> 00:18:22.334
Sorry to interrupt training, but the precogs
just predicted a crime! Move out!

00:18:24.314 --> 00:18:26.114
My patented paralyzing attack!

00:18:26.114 --> 00:18:27.604
This creep again?!

00:18:28.014 --> 00:18:30.284
My patented clairvoyance!

00:18:30.284 --> 00:18:33.014
And away they go! Away they go!

00:18:33.014 --> 00:18:35.454
I can see! I can see!

00:18:35.454 --> 00:18:37.324
Hold it!

00:18:37.824 --> 00:18:39.294
Who?!

00:18:40.194 --> 00:18:41.864
You won't escape this time!

00:18:41.864 --> 00:18:43.494
The special esper again?

00:18:43.494 --> 00:18:47.364
Code name, Kitty Cat! And
I'm here to do my duty!

00:18:47.364 --> 00:18:50.564
Dammit, I'll! Um, what's with your clothes?

00:18:54.944 --> 00:18:57.644
Yes! Peek-a-boo nudity with a high school girl!

00:18:57.644 --> 00:19:00.144
And the embarrassment...
Nothing's hotter than that!

00:19:00.144 --> 00:19:01.814
TOO HOT!

00:19:01.814 --> 00:19:04.754
I'm gonna take it up a notch!

00:19:04.754 --> 00:19:09.584
Super patented clairvoyance!

00:19:10.624 --> 00:19:12.314
M-My body!

00:19:15.424 --> 00:19:16.554
I can see!

00:19:16.964 --> 00:19:22.204
Yes! Transparent! Her uniform's transparent!
No! Stop it! Stop it, please! Stop!

00:19:22.204 --> 00:19:25.174
I can see! I can see! I can see!

00:19:25.734 --> 00:19:29.174
I CAN SEE!

00:19:29.744 --> 00:19:31.104
Huh?

00:19:32.944 --> 00:19:35.074
You're... not wearing any...

00:19:38.584 --> 00:19:40.684
NAOMI!

00:19:40.684 --> 00:19:43.994
Are you all right, Kitty Cat?! My Naomi!

00:19:43.994 --> 00:19:44.924
"My?"

00:19:45.154 --> 00:19:49.394
Why, you... What have you done to the
girl I've poured so much work into?!

00:19:49.794 --> 00:19:53.734
Who are you? I like seeing underwear!
Why isn't she wearing any?!

00:19:53.864 --> 00:19:55.434
What nonsense is that?!
Something's... coming.

00:19:55.434 --> 00:19:56.834
If you want to see that, then...
Something's... coming.

00:19:57.334 --> 00:20:01.704
The thing in my heart holding me back is... Is!

00:20:02.044 --> 00:20:02.974
Hey!

00:20:04.644 --> 00:20:10.214
I... I hate... I really hate!

00:20:10.214 --> 00:20:13.084
CREEPY OLD GUYS!

00:20:14.254 --> 00:20:17.284
YOU CREEPY MIDDLE-AGED PERVERTS!

00:20:22.164 --> 00:20:24.394
N-Naomi!

00:20:24.594 --> 00:20:27.834
I hate your oily eyes on me!

00:20:27.834 --> 00:20:31.364
The creepy way you use your hands!
I hate everything about you!

00:20:31.704 --> 00:20:34.974
But, I had my reasons! I want you to be ideal!

00:20:34.974 --> 00:20:38.844
Shut up! Don't talk! Don't breathe!
Don't move! Don't look at me!

00:20:38.844 --> 00:20:40.334
SHUT UP!

00:20:41.514 --> 00:20:42.944
What the?!

00:20:43.444 --> 00:20:46.114
Looks like Naomi's heart has
finally been released.

00:20:47.284 --> 00:20:51.394
The truth is, she hates creepy old
guys like Supervisor Tanizaki.

00:20:51.394 --> 00:20:53.224
That was the cause of her slump.

00:20:53.224 --> 00:20:55.924
I just played at being like those two pervs...

00:20:55.994 --> 00:20:59.234
to release her true feelings.

00:20:59.234 --> 00:21:01.094
Was that really an act, though?

00:21:10.074 --> 00:21:14.284
My... wild... Naomi...

00:21:14.284 --> 00:21:18.214
You've taken another step towards
being my ideal woman.

00:21:24.694 --> 00:21:26.454
