00:21:26.454 --> 00:21:29.124
Ah, good morning, Naomi!

00:21:33.764 --> 00:21:37.324
I see Naomi's back to her old self. Good, good.

00:21:37.434 --> 00:21:39.334
I hope she turns back to her old self.

00:21:41.744 --> 00:21:45.104
Incident alert. Special espers, move out.

00:21:45.414 --> 00:21:47.274
Let's go, my Naomi.

00:21:48.614 --> 00:21:52.614
